      "type": "text",
      "value": "Assume, a blood sample is given. Construct a biosensor using 0.3M CuS04 (aq) to determine (I 5) the quantity of iron (Fe) in the blood in molar concentration. In the given ambience, the room temperature is 25DC and the constructed sensor generates +0.794V."
